
"smart_sources:- About, Silver and Gold Book (Conflicted copy Laptop (IdahoPTV) 202607281750).md": {"path":"- About, Silver and Gold Book (Conflicted copy Laptop (IdahoPTV) 202607281750).md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"hidjuq","at":1785792234175},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1785282671175,"size":7978,"at":1785792234360,"hash":"hidjuq"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,10],"##About the Collection":[11,12],"##About the Collection[2]":[13,61],"##About the Collection[2]#{1}":[15,52],"##About the Collection[2]#Technical Credits - CollectionBuilder":[53,61],"##About the Collection[2]#Technical Credits - CollectionBuilder#{1}":[55,61]},"outlinks":[{"title":"U of I Library Special Collections","target":"U of I Library Special Collections","line":5},{"title":"Archives; University of Idaho Library Digital Collections","target":"Archives; University of Idaho Library Digital Collections","line":6},{"title":"Idaho","target":"Idaho","line":15},{"title":"Jewelry box is sitting on bottom edge as if it is a book. Edge is styled as a book spine, featuring a silver relief of pine cones, the Idaho state seal (the only state seal designed by a woman), and the dates 1863 (the year Idaho Territory was created) and 1893 (the year of the exposition). Front cover features etching of original Administration Building, gold reliefs of wheat shafts and representations of industries that were important to early Idaho's development.  ","target":"https://objects.lib.uidaho.edu/silver-gold/small/silvergold_006_sm.jpg","line":17,"embedded":true},{"title":"A handwritten note address to Tiffany and Co. Jewelers requesting after any information the firm might have about the production of the Silver and Gold Book, signed by Gertrude Axtell","target":"https://objects.lib.uidaho.edu/silver-gold/small/documentation-mid-century_24_sm.jpg","line":23,"embedded":true},{"title":"Newspaper article titled \"College Library to Display Gold and Silver Book,\" clipped without citation information","target":"https://objects.lib.uidaho.edu/silver-gold/small/documentation-mid-century_28_sm.jpg","line":27,"embedded":true},{"title":"Eight of the original members of the Pleiades Club. Jennie P. Gault, Florence R. Chrisman, Martha Fox, Kate R. Henderson, Sara C. Ostrander, C. W. McCurdy, Ellen R. Aldrich and Millicent C. Bonebright.","target":"https://objects.lib.uidaho.edu/silver-gold/small/mg025_bx1_002_sm.jpg","line":35,"embedded":true},{"title":"Group photograph of the 2023 Pleiades Club members. Front: Cathy Willmes, Terry Peterson, Peggy Conrad, Mary Reed. Back: Andrea Fountain, Nancy Sasser, Nancy Lyle, Helen Boisen, Prudy Heimsch, Denise Thomson, Harriet Hughes. Not pictured:  Kathy Barnard-LaPointe, Barbara Meldrum, Nancy Ruth Peterson.","target":"https://objects.lib.uidaho.edu/silver-gold/small/pleiades_sm.jpg","line":39,"embedded":true},{"title":"Close up detail of one short edge of object which appears as the top edge of the book. Featuring an etched scene of a covered wagon and emigrant family.","target":"https://objects.lib.uidaho.edu/silver-gold/small/silvergold_027_sm.jpg","line":49,"embedded":true},{"title":"CollectionBuilder","target":"https://collectionbuilder.github.io/","line":55},{"title":"Lib-Static","target":"https://lib-static.github.io/","line":55},{"title":"CollectionBuilder-CSV","target":"https://github.com/CollectionBuilder/collectionbuilder-csv","line":57},{"title":"Jekyll","target":"https://jekyllrb.com/","line":57},{"title":"![CollectionBuilder","target":"https://www.lib.uidaho.edu/digital/silver-gold/assets/img/collectionbuilder-logo.png","line":59}],"metadata":{"title":"About, Silver and Gold Book","source":"https://www.lib.uidaho.edu/digital/silver-gold/about.html","author":["[[U of I Library Special Collections]]","[[Archives; University of Idaho Library Digital Collections]]"],"published":null,"created":"2026-07-20","description":"The Silver and Gold Book was created to represent Moscow at 